Projectify can be used without the main [[Dashboard|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Dashboard]]. All UI views can be linked or transcluded into any tiddler, daily note, or custom layout:

* ''Projects'': Add the <<tag Project>> tag to any tiddler to automatically display its task list or Kanban board.
* ''Inbox'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/inbox/Inbox}}`
* ''Active Projects'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Projects}}`
* ''Today & Overdue'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Today}}`
* ''Upcoming Schedule'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Upcoming}}`
* ''Next Actions'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/NextActions}}`
* ''Eisenhower Matrix'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Matrix}}`
* ''Weekly Review & Logbook'': `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Review}}`
